### Requirements
| ID | Kind | Requirement |
|---|---|---|
| MB-R-161 | new | A TCP client whose connection drops without a user disconnect enters the reconnecting state. |
| MB-R-042 | changed · dropped connection no longer ends in disconnected | A TCP client whose connection drops **enters the reconnecting state**. |
| MB-E-031 | new | A request in flight when the connection drops is lost, not replayed. |
| MB-E-007 | dropped | stated "no automatic reconnect"; MB-R-161 replaces it |

